# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add any of these to git commits, commit messages, or pull requests:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent`
- `cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`

Commits for this repo must be authored only as the repo owner (`samemaan`). Do not add Cursor as a co-author or contributor in any form.
